****Note**** This is a 68030 optimized version of CONFG and CTDL
If you do not have a 68030 or 68040, this will probably crash and
could possibly mess up your data.  I am running this version and
it is fine for a 68030 system.  This version while optimized for the
68030 will probably work fine on a 68020 based system.

Note:  if you are running Version .P25 or earlier, you must get the
message files from the C342P30.LHA archive in addition to this file
and update your system accordingly.
